 "description": "This new generation Smart Card programmable module offers a highly secure architecture with state of the art on board cryptographic services that include and even exceed NSA SUITE-B cryptography with Advanced Encryption Standard (AES up to 256); Secure Hash Algorithm (SHA up to 512); Elliptic-Curve Diffie-Hellman (ECDH) and Digital Signature Algorithm (ECDSA up to P-521). The module supports Java Card 2.2.2 and Global Platform 2.1.1.A with Delegated Management, and is available with contact (ISO 7816) and contactless (ISO 14443) communication interfaces.",
